00:29:41.890 --> 00:29:44.580
All right, so they look
pretty much the same

00:29:44.580 --> 00:29:47.082
as the other ones.

00:29:47.082 --> 00:29:48.750
But you can see
that this one just

00:29:48.750 --> 00:29:50.290
happened about 20 minutes ago.

00:29:53.170 --> 00:29:58.500
So that is, in a nutshell,
how to do serverless

00:29:58.500 --> 00:30:02.825
managed DevOps with
Android on GCP.

00:30:02.825 --> 00:30:09.140
It's CloudBuild plus
Firebase Test Lab.

